#: flowing.interfaces:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces`` —— 暴露层子包：CLI / REPL / HTTP serve / Web 前端入口。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces`` —— the interface layer subpackage: CLI / REPL / HTTP serve / Web frontend entry points."

#: flowing.interfaces:4 flowing.interfaces.controls:4
#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:4 flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:4
#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:4 flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:4
