msgid "功能介绍"
msgstr "Overview"

#: flowing.interfaces:5 of
msgid ""
"本子包是 Flowing 的暴露层：为 ``flowing`` 命令行工具提供进程入口与 "
"各子命令实现。暴露层的唯一职责是“``launch(path, **kwargs)`` 拿 Runtime”——所有子命令拿到 Runtime "
"之后做什么，是本包各模块的全部 差异。"
msgstr ""
"This subpackage is Flowing's interface layer: it provides the process entry point and the "
"per-subcommand implementations for the ``flowing`` command-line tool. The interface layer's sole responsibility is \"``launch(path, **kwargs)`` to get a Runtime\" — what each subcommand does after getting the Runtime "
"is the entire difference between the modules of this package."

#: flowing.interfaces:10 of
msgid ""
"子命令封闭集由 :data:`SUBCOMMANDS` 定义，共八个名字：``run`` / ``repl`` / ``cli`` / "
"``repl-debug`` / ``serve`` / ``web`` / ``test`` / ``compile``。其中 ``cli`` "
"是 ``repl`` 的别名，二者走同一代码路径； 不接受插件或配置注册新子命令。``compile`` 不拉起 Runtime，是唯一 不经 "
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch` 的子命令。"
msgstr ""
"The closed set of subcommands is defined by :data:`SUBCOMMANDS`, eight names in total: ``run`` / ``repl`` / ``cli`` / "
"``repl-debug`` / ``serve`` / ``web`` / ``test`` / ``compile``. ``cli`` is an alias of ``repl`` and the two share "
"the same code path; plugins or configuration cannot register new subcommands. ``compile`` does not start a Runtime and is the only subcommand that does not go through "
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`."

#: flowing.interfaces:16 of
msgid "边界（暴露层只做“拉起”这一件事）："
msgstr "Boundaries (the interface layer only does one thing: \"launching\"):"

#: flowing.interfaces:18 of
msgid ""
"不解析配置文件（``providers.yaml`` / ``models.yaml`` 等）——配置 读取是框架核心与子项目 ``main`` "
"执行期间的职责。"
msgstr ""
"Does not parse configuration files (``providers.yaml`` / ``models.yaml``, etc.) — reading configuration is the responsibility of the framework core and of the subproject ``main`` "
"while it executes."

#: flowing.interfaces:20 of
msgid "不认识插件——CLI 不知道 ``runtime.install(...)`` 装过什么，也不为任何 插件提供命令行开关。"
msgstr "Does not know about plugins — the CLI does not know what ``runtime.install(...)`` has installed, and provides no command-line switches for any plugin."

#: flowing.interfaces:22 of
msgid ""
"不感知 ``@``——``@/`` 是框架内部的项目根前缀，由 :func:`flowing.runtime.launch` 登记到 "
"asyncio Task 上下文；命令行的 ``<path>`` 是普通文件系统路径（``.`` 或任意目录），CLI 原样交给 "
"``launch``。"
msgstr ""
"Is unaware of ``@`` — ``@/`` is the framework-internal project-root prefix, registered into the asyncio Task context by "
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`; the command-line ``<path>`` is an ordinary filesystem path (``.`` or any directory), which the CLI passes to "
"``launch`` unchanged."

#: flowing.interfaces:28 of
msgid "子模块划分"
msgstr "Module Breakdown"

#: flowing.interfaces:29 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.cli`` —— 进程入口 ``main()`` 与 ``compile`` 子命令。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.cli`` —— the process entry point ``main()`` and the ``compile`` subcommand."

#: flowing.interfaces:31 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.repl`` —— 交互式 REPL（``repl`` / 别名 ``cli``）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.repl`` —— the interactive REPL (``repl`` / alias ``cli``)."

#: flowing.interfaces:33 of
