"``flowing.interfaces.repl_debug`` —— ``repl`` 的调试扩展版 （``repl-debug``，增加 4"
" 个调试 slash-command）。"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.interfaces.repl_debug`` —— a debug-extended variant of ``repl`` (``repl-debug``, adding 4 debug "
"slash-commands)."

#: flowing.interfaces:35 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.run`` —— 一次性执行（``run``）与冒烟测试 （``test``）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.run`` —— one-shot execution (``run``) and smoke testing (``test``)."

#: flowing.interfaces:37 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.serve`` —— HTTP API 服务（``serve``，纯 API 无前端）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.serve`` —— the HTTP API service (``serve``, pure API, no frontend)."

#: flowing.interfaces:39 flowing.interfaces.web:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.web`` —— ``web`` 子命令与内置默认前端资产。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.web`` —— the ``web`` subcommand and the builtin default frontend assets."

#: flowing.interfaces:40 of
msgid ""
"共享件（本包顶层）：``SUBCOMMANDS`` / ``EXIT_OK`` / ``EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`` / "
"``EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`` / ``parse_kv_args``。"
msgstr ""
"Shared pieces (top level of this package): ``SUBCOMMANDS`` / ``EXIT_OK`` / ``EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`` / "
"``EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`` / ``parse_kv_args``."

#: flowing.interfaces:44 of
msgid "全局约定（跨符号、影响使用的约定）"
msgstr "Global Conventions (cross-symbol conventions that affect usage)"

#: flowing.interfaces:45 of
msgid "参数分层（横线数即归属）："
msgstr "Argument layering (the number of dashes indicates ownership):"

#: flowing.interfaces:47 of
msgid ""
"位置参数 ``<path>``：子项目路径，缺省 ``.`` （``flowing test --key val`` 等价于 ``flowing "
"test . --key val``）。"
msgstr ""
"Positional argument ``<path>``: the subproject path, default ``.`` (``flowing test --key val`` is equivalent to ``flowing "
"test . --key val``)."

#: flowing.interfaces:49 of
msgid ""
"flowing 级参数一律单横线：``-m <file>`` （入口 main 文件，缺省 ``@/main.py``）；``-a "
"<host>`` / ``-p <port>`` （serve / web 专属 监听地址，默认 "
"``127.0.0.1:8000``）；``-h`` / ``--help`` （帮助）。 全部在 ``cmd_*`` 分发层剥离，不进入子项目 "
"``main`` 的 kwargs。"
msgstr ""
"flowing-level arguments always use a single dash: ``-m <file>`` (the entry main file, default ``@/main.py``); ``-a "
"<host>`` / ``-p <port>`` (the listen address specific to serve / web, default "
"``127.0.0.1:8000``); ``-h`` / ``--help`` (help). All of them are stripped at the ``cmd_*`` dispatch layer and never enter the subproject "
"``main``'s kwargs."

#: flowing.interfaces:53 of
msgid ""
"子项目 ``main`` 的参数一律双横线：``--key value`` 经 :func:`parse_kv_args` 收集，经 "
"``launch(path, **kwargs)`` 原样透传 给 ``main(**kwargs)``——即使代码里参数命名为单字母，CLI "
"上也写 ``--x val``。``--help`` 是 CLI 保留字，不透传给 ``main``。"
msgstr ""
"Arguments for the subproject ``main`` always use double dashes: ``--key value`` is collected by :func:`parse_kv_args` and passed through unchanged via "
"``launch(path, **kwargs)`` to ``main(**kwargs)`` — even if a parameter is named with a single letter in code, the CLI "
"still writes ``--x val``. ``--help`` is a CLI reserved word and is not passed to ``main``."

#: flowing.interfaces:58 of
msgid ""
"退出码（所有子命令统一，见 :data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` / "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`）："
msgstr ""
"Exit codes (uniform across all subcommands, see :data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` / "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`):"

#: flowing.interfaces:61 of
msgid ""
"``0``：正常退出——包括 ``/exit``、EOF（Ctrl-D），以及收到 SIGINT / SIGTERM "
"后走优雅关闭路径完成的退出（视为正常关闭）。"
msgstr ""
"``0``: normal exit — includes ``/exit``, EOF (Ctrl-D), and exits completed through the graceful-shutdown path after receiving SIGINT / SIGTERM "
"(treated as a normal shutdown)."

#: flowing.interfaces:63 of
msgid ""
"``1``：运行时错误——``launch`` 失败（子项目 ``main`` 抛异常、 项目不可 import 等）、serve / web "
"端口绑定失败、compile 检测到 产物被外部修改。"
msgstr ""
"``1``: runtime error — ``launch`` failure (the subproject ``main`` raised, the project cannot be imported, etc.), serve / web "
"port binding failure, or compile detecting that an artifact was modified externally."

#: flowing.interfaces:66 of
msgid "``2``：用法错误——未知子命令、``<path>`` 指向不存在的目录、 ``<path>`` 之后出现非 ``--key`` 形式的裸参数。"
msgstr "``2``: usage error — unknown subcommand, ``<path>`` pointing to a nonexistent directory, or a bare argument that is not in ``--key`` form appearing after ``<path>``."

#: flowing.interfaces:69 of
msgid ""
"信号处理：各子命令自行安装自己的信号处理器（不共享统一安装件）—— ``run`` / ``serve`` / ``web`` 装 SIGINT "
"/ SIGTERM → ``runtime.shutdown()`` 的优雅关闭桥；``repl`` 装交互语义：回合进行中 SIGINT "
"取消当前回合 （``abort_turn``），提示符空闲时中断当前输入行（Ctrl-D 或 ``/exit`` 退出）。优雅关闭桥只发起 "
"``shutdown()``（非阻塞，立即返回）； ``shutdown()`` 完成递归 destroy 全部节点与插件收尾后置位退出事件， "
"``await runtime`` 处随即唤醒，进程以退出码 ``0`` 退出。框架不实现 “二次信号强制 "
"kill”——关闭卡死时的兜底是应用层职责。"
msgstr ""
"Signal handling: each subcommand installs its own signal handlers (no shared installer) — ``run`` / ``serve`` / ``web`` install a graceful-shutdown bridge from SIGINT "
"/ SIGTERM to ``runtime.shutdown()``; ``repl`` installs interactive semantics: SIGINT during a turn "
"cancels the current turn (``abort_turn``), while at an idle prompt it interrupts the current input line (Ctrl-D or ``/exit`` exits). The graceful-shutdown bridge only initiates "
"``shutdown()`` (non-blocking, returning immediately); once ``shutdown()`` has recursively destroyed all nodes and finished plugin teardown it sets the exit event, whereupon "
"``await runtime`` wakes and the process exits with exit code ``0``. The framework does not implement a \"second-signal force "
"kill\" — the fallback for a stuck shutdown is the application layer's responsibility."

#: flowing.interfaces:78 of
msgid ""
"封闭观察窗口：默认 ``repl`` 的 slash-command 集合与默认 ``serve`` 的 HTTP "
"端点集合都是封闭的，不接受运行时注册新命令 / 新端点——它们是 “刚启动项目、想快速发条消息看看、查个快照”的最小观察窗口，不是可 "
"扩展的交互框架。需要自定义命令或端点时，继承内置实现扩展（``repl-debug`` 对 ``repl`` "
"的扩展方式即内置注入点的用法），或自己实现一个 repl / HTTP server（经 ``query()`` / "
"``enqueue_message()`` / ``snapshot()`` 等公开 API）。"
msgstr ""
"Closed observation windows: both the default ``repl`` slash-command set and the default ``serve`` HTTP "
"endpoint set are closed — no new commands or endpoints can be registered at runtime. They are the minimal observation windows for \"just started a project, want to quickly send a message and check a snapshot\", not extensible "
"interaction frameworks. When custom commands or endpoints are needed, extend the builtin implementations by inheritance (the way ``repl-debug`` extends ``repl`` "
"demonstrates the builtin injection points), or implement your own repl / HTTP server (via the public APIs ``query()`` / "
"``enqueue_message()`` / ``snapshot()``, etc.)."

#: flowing.interfaces:86 of
msgid ""
"流式：``serve`` / ``web`` 的 HTTP API 提供请求/响应模型 （``POST /agents/<agent-"
"id>/message`` 投递消息并等待回合结果），另经 ``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream`` 提供 SSE "
"流式推送（生成过程的 delta 事件）。WebSocket 不引入。"
msgstr ""
"Streaming: the ``serve`` / ``web`` HTTP API provides a request/response model (``POST /agents/<agent-"
"id>/message`` delivers a message and waits for the turn result), and additionally offers SSE streaming via ``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream`` "
"(delta events of the generation process). WebSocket is not introduced."

