#: flowing.interfaces.SUBCOMMANDS:1 of
msgid "子命令封闭集：``flowing`` 命令行工具的全部子命令名字。"
msgstr "The closed subcommand set: all subcommand names of the ``flowing`` command-line tool."

#: flowing.interfaces.SUBCOMMANDS:3 of
msgid ""
"出现在 ``flowing`` 之后的第一个位置参数必须命中本集合，否则按用法 错误处理（向 stderr 打印用法并以 "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR` 退出）。 名字比较是精确小写匹配，不做前缀匹配或模糊匹配。``cli`` 是 ``repl`` "
"的别名，分发时归一化为 ``repl`` （同一代码路径）。"
msgstr ""
"The first positional argument after ``flowing`` must match this set, otherwise it is handled as a usage error (usage is printed to stderr and the process exits with "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`). Name comparison is exact lowercase matching — no prefix or fuzzy matching. ``cli`` is an alias of ``repl`` "
"and is normalized to ``repl`` at dispatch (same code path)."

#: flowing.interfaces.SUBCOMMANDS:8 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main`、:data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main`, :data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_OK:1 of
msgid "退出码：正常退出。"
msgstr "Exit code: normal exit."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_OK:3 of
msgid ""
"包括 ``/exit``、EOF（Ctrl-D），以及收到 SIGINT / SIGTERM 后走优雅关闭 "
"路径完成的退出——信号驱动的关闭被视为正常关闭，不以 ``130`` 之类的 信号惯例码退出。"
msgstr ""
"Includes ``/exit``, EOF (Ctrl-D), and exits completed through the graceful-shutdown path after receiving SIGINT / SIGTERM — signal-driven shutdown is treated as a normal shutdown and does not exit with a signal-convention code such as ``130``."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_OK:7 of
msgid ":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`、:data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"
msgstr ":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`, :data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR:1 of
msgid "退出码：运行时错误。"
msgstr "Exit code: runtime error."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR:3 of
msgid ""
"``launch`` 失败（子项目 ``main`` 抛异常、``main.py`` 缺失或不可 import 等）、serve / web "
"的端口绑定失败、compile 检测到产物被外部 修改，均以此码退出；错误详情打印到 stderr。"
msgstr ""
"``launch`` failures (the subproject ``main`` raised, ``main.py`` is missing or cannot be imported, etc.), serve / web "
"port binding failures, and compile detecting externally modified artifacts all exit with this code; error details are printed to stderr."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR:7 of
msgid ":data:`EXIT_OK`、:data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"
msgstr ":data:`EXIT_OK`, :data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`"

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_USAGE_ERROR:1 of
msgid "退出码：用法错误。"
msgstr "Exit code: usage error."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_USAGE_ERROR:3 of
msgid ""
"未知子命令、``<path>`` 指向不存在的目录、``<path>`` 之后出现 非 ``--key`` "
"形式的裸参数，均以此码退出；用法说明打印到 stderr。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown subcommands, ``<path>`` pointing to a nonexistent directory, and bare arguments in non-``--key`` "
"form appearing after ``<path>`` all exit with this code; usage instructions are printed to stderr."

#: flowing.interfaces.EXIT_USAGE_ERROR:6 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main`、:func:`parse_kv_args`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main`, :func:`parse_kv_args`"

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:1 of
msgid "把 ``--key value`` 形式的参数列表收集为 ``**kwargs`` 字典。"
msgstr "Collects an argument list in ``--key value`` form into a ``**kwargs`` dictionary."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:3 of
msgid ""
"CLI 与子项目 ``main(**kwargs)`` 之间的唯一参数通道。CLI 不理解 "
"任何参数的语义，只做机械转换后原样转发——参数名与类型语义由 子项目 ``main`` 的签名决定。"
msgstr ""
"The sole argument channel between the CLI and the subproject ``main(**kwargs)``. The CLI does not understand the "
"semantics of any argument; it only performs a mechanical conversion and forwards the result unchanged — argument names and type semantics are defined by the subproject ``main``'s signature."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:22 flowing.interfaces.cli.main:23
#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:21 flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:35
#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:69 flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:17
#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:36 flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:44
