#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:26 of
msgid "行为要点"
msgstr "Key Behaviors"

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:22 of
msgid ""
"``--key value``：一个键值对；``key`` 中的 ``-`` 全部转 ``_``； ``value`` "
"以字符串原样传递，不做类型推断（``main`` 自行转换 类型）。"
msgstr ""
"``--key value``: one key-value pair; every ``-`` in ``key`` is converted to ``_``; ``value`` "
"is passed as a string unchanged, with no type inference (``main`` converts types itself)."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:25 of
msgid "``--key`` 后随另一个 ``--`` 开头项或列表结尾：值为 ``True`` （布尔 flag）。"
msgstr "``--key`` followed by another ``--``-prefixed item or the end of the list: the value is ``True`` (boolean flag)."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:27 of
msgid "同一个 ``--key`` 出现多次：后者覆盖前者，不累积为列表。"
msgstr "The same ``--key`` appearing multiple times: the later one overrides the earlier one; values do not accumulate into a list."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:28 of
msgid ""
"不以 ``--`` 开头的裸参数与 ``--key=value`` 等号形式：跳过， 不收入结果——这些形态的用法错误由 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main` 在调用本函数之前报出。"
msgstr ""
"Bare arguments not starting with ``--`` and the ``--key=value`` equals-sign form: skipped and not collected into the "
"result — usage errors of these forms are reported by :func:`flowing.interfaces.cli.main` before it calls this function."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:31 of
msgid "空列表返回空字典。"
msgstr "An empty list returns an empty dictionary."

#: flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args:36 of
msgid "收集结果经 ``launch(path, **kwargs)`` 透传给子项目 ``main``。"
msgstr "The collection result is passed through to the subproject ``main`` via ``launch(path, **kwargs)``."

