#: flowing.interfaces.cli:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.cli`` —— CLI 进程入口（``main``）与 ``compile`` 子命令。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.cli`` —— the CLI process entry point (``main``) and the ``compile`` subcommand."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli:3 of
msgid ""
"本模块只做两件事：解析 argv 并分发到各子命令（参数分层 / 退出码 / 信号处理的总约定见 ``flowing.interfaces`` 包"
" docstring），以及 ``.fya`` 显式编译壳（:func:`cmd_compile`）。"
msgstr ""
"This module does only two things: parse argv and dispatch to the subcommands (the overall conventions for argument layering / exit codes / signal handling are in the ``flowing.interfaces`` package"
" docstring), plus the explicit ``.fya`` compilation shell (:func:`cmd_compile`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:1 of
msgid "CLI 进程入口：解析子命令并分发，返回进程退出码。"
msgstr "CLI process entry point: parses the subcommand and dispatches, returning the process exit code."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:3 of
msgid ""
"``flowing`` 可执行脚本的入口函数。解析 ``argv`` 的第一个位置参数 为子命令名（``cli`` 归一化为 "
"``repl``），第二个位置参数为子项目 路径 ``<path>`` （缺省 ``.``）；剥离 flowing 级单横线参数 （``-h`` "
"/ ``--help`` / ``-m`` / ``-a`` / ``-p``，归属见包 docstring“参数分层”），其余 ``--key "
"value`` 参数经 :func:`parse_kv_args` 收集，然后分发到对应的 ``cmd_*`` 协程并以 "
"``asyncio.run`` 驱动（``compile`` 除外，它是同步函数，直接调用）。"
msgstr ""
"The entry function of the ``flowing`` executable script. It parses the first positional argument of ``argv`` as the subcommand name (``cli`` is normalized to "
"``repl``) and the second positional argument as the subproject path ``<path>`` (default ``.``); it strips the flowing-level single-dash arguments (``-h`` "
"/ ``--help`` / ``-m`` / ``-a`` / ``-p``; ownership is described in the package docstring section \"argument layering\"), collects the remaining ``--key "
"value`` arguments via :func:`parse_kv_args`, then dispatches to the corresponding ``cmd_*`` coroutine driven by "
"``asyncio.run`` (except ``compile``, which is a synchronous function called directly)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:24 of
msgid "``argv is None`` 时取 ``sys.argv[1:]``。"
msgstr "When ``argv is None``, ``sys.argv[1:]`` is used."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:25 of
msgid ""
"空 ``argv``、未知子命令 → 向 stderr 打印总 用法（含子命令封闭集清单），返回 "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`。 子命令名比较是精确小写匹配，不做前缀或模糊匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Empty ``argv`` or unknown subcommand → print the overall usage (including the closed subcommand list) to stderr and return "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`. Subcommand name comparison is exact lowercase matching — no prefix or fuzzy matching."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:28 of
msgid ""
"``<path>`` 指向不存在的目录 → 返回 :data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR` （路径存在性在 CLI 层检查，先于 "
"``launch``）。"
msgstr ""
"``<path>`` pointing to a nonexistent directory → return :data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR` (path existence is checked at the CLI layer, before "
"``launch``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:31 of
msgid ""
"``-h`` / ``--help`` → 向 stdout 打印该子命令用法，返回 "
":data:`EXIT_OK`，不执行任何分发；``--help`` 为 CLI 保留字， 不透传给 ``main``。"
msgstr ""
"``-h`` / ``--help`` → print that subcommand's usage to stdout and return "
":data:`EXIT_OK` without any dispatch; ``--help`` is a CLI reserved word and is not passed to ``main``."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:34 of
msgid ""
"flowing 级参数（``-m`` / ``-a`` / ``-p``）按子命令归属作为显式 参数传给对应的 ``cmd_*`` （``-a``"
" / ``-p`` 只传给 ``serve`` / ``web``），不进入 ``main`` 的 kwargs；``--key value`` "
"收集结果 经 ``cmd_*`` 的 ``**kwargs`` 原样透传给 ``launch`` 与子项目 ``main``。"
msgstr ""
"flowing-level arguments (``-m`` / ``-a`` / ``-p``) are passed as explicit arguments to the owning ``cmd_*`` according to subcommand ownership (``-a``"
" / ``-p`` only go to ``serve`` / ``web``) and never enter ``main``'s kwargs; the collected ``--key value`` "
"result is passed through unchanged to ``launch`` and the subproject ``main`` via the ``cmd_*``'s ``**kwargs``."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:39 of
msgid "子命令协程返回的退出码原样作为本函数的返回值。"
msgstr "The exit code returned by the subcommand coroutine becomes this function's return value unchanged."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:40 of
msgid ""
"``launch`` 失败由各 ``cmd_*`` 内部处理（向 stderr 打印异常 摘要并返回 "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`），本函数不捕获重试。"
msgstr ""
"``launch`` failures are handled inside each ``cmd_*`` (printing an exception summary to stderr and returning "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`); this function does not catch and retry."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:43 of
msgid "命令行参数列表（不含程序名）；``None`` 时取 ``sys.argv[1:]``。"
msgstr "The command-line argument list (without the program name); when ``None``, ``sys.argv[1:]`` is used."

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:45 of
msgid ""
"进程退出码（:data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` / "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR` 之一）。"
msgstr ""
"The process exit code (one of :data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` / "
":data:`EXIT_USAGE_ERROR`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:50 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args` —— ``--key value``"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.parse_kv_args` —— ``--key value``"

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:51 of
msgid "参数的收集规则。"
msgstr "collection rules for the arguments."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.main:52 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`、 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`、 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug`、 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve`、 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`、 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test`、:func:`cmd_compile` —— 各子命令的行为契约。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`, "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`, "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug`, "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve`, "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`, "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test`, :func:`cmd_compile` —— the behavioral contract of each subcommand."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:1 of
msgid "``flowing compile <path>``：把 ``.fya`` 显式编译为同目录 ``.py``。"
msgstr "``flowing compile <path>``: explicitly compiles ``.fya`` files into same-directory ``.py`` files."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:3 of
msgid ""
"递归扫描 ``<path>`` 下全部 ``*.fya`` （工具与技能定义 ——``TOOL.fya`` / ``*.tool.fya`` / "
"``*.skill.fya``——静默跳过， 只编译 Agent 定义），逐文件编译为同目录同名 ``.py`` （去 ``.fya`` "
"后缀，兼容 ``from payment import PaymentAgent`` 这类导入）。hash 元信息写在各产物同目录的 "
"``.flowing.meta.yaml`` （三字段：源解析结构 hash / 产物 AST hash / 编译器版本）。本命令不拉起 "
"Runtime、不执行子项目 ``main``，是 唯一不经 :func:`flowing.runtime.launch` "
"的子命令，因此是同步函数。"
msgstr ""
"Recursively scans all ``*.fya`` files under ``<path>`` (tool and skill definitions — ``TOOL.fya`` / ``*.tool.fya`` / "
"``*.skill.fya`` — are silently skipped; only Agent definitions are compiled), compiling each file into a same-named ``.py`` in the same directory (with the ``.fya`` "
"suffix removed, so imports like ``from payment import PaymentAgent`` keep working). Hash metadata is written to ``.flowing.meta.yaml`` in each artifact's directory "
"(three fields: source parse-structure hash / artifact AST hash / compiler version). This command neither starts a "
"Runtime nor executes the subproject ``main``; it is the only subcommand that does not go through :func:`flowing.runtime.launch` "
"and is therefore a synchronous function."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:23 of
msgid ""
"产物中的 Parsable 值以类体赋值形式写出（如 ``system_prompt = Parsable('$./system-"
"prompt.md')``）。"
msgstr ""
"Parsable values in the artifacts are written out as class-body assignments (e.g. ``system_prompt = Parsable('$./system-"
"prompt.md')``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:25 of
msgid "重新编译条件：源 ``.fya`` 的解析结构 hash 变化，或 ``compiler_version`` 与 meta 中记录的不同。"
msgstr "Recompilation condition: the parse-structure hash of the source ``.fya`` changes, or ``compiler_version`` differs from what is recorded in the meta."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:27 of
msgid ""
"``.py`` 产物被外部修改（AST hash 不匹配）→ 报错中止，不静默 覆盖：向 stderr 打印冲突文件路径，返回 "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`；本次已产出的其他文件不回滚（编译 是幂等的，重跑可继续）。"
msgstr ""
"A ``.py`` artifact modified externally (AST hash mismatch) → abort with an error instead of silently overwriting: print the conflicting file paths to stderr and return "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`; other files already produced in this run are not rolled back (compilation is idempotent and can be continued by re-running)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:31 of
msgid "不删除无对应 ``.fya`` 的孤儿 ``.py`` （编译只覆盖 ``.fya`` 一侧，不清理产物目录）。"
msgstr "Orphan ``.py`` files without a corresponding ``.fya`` are not deleted (compilation only covers the ``.fya`` side and never cleans the artifact directory)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:33 of
msgid "项目内无 ``*.fya`` → 打印“无可编译文件”，返回 :data:`EXIT_OK`。"
msgstr "No ``*.fya`` in the project → print \"no compilable files\" and return :data:`EXIT_OK`."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:35 of
msgid "无变更时重复执行等价 no-op（全量命中 hash，产物不变）。"
msgstr "Re-running with no changes is equivalent to a no-op (all hashes match and the artifacts stay unchanged)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:37 of
msgid "子项目目录（普通文件系统路径）。"
msgstr "The subproject directory (an ordinary filesystem path)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:38 of
msgid ":data:`EXIT_OK` （成功或无可编译文件）或 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` （产物被外部修改）。"
msgstr ":data:`EXIT_OK` (success or nothing to compile) or :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` (an artifact was modified externally)."

#: flowing.interfaces.cli.cmd_compile:43 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.compiler.compile_project` —— 编译实现。 :func:`main` —— "
"分发规则（``compile`` 不经事件循环，同步 直调）。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.compiler.compile_project` —— the compilation implementation. :func:`main` —— "
"the dispatch rules (``compile`` does not go through the event loop and is called synchronously)."

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:21
msgid "flowing.interfaces.controls module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.controls module"

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.controls`` —— 共享 slash 命令目录（repl 与 serve/web 同源）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.controls`` —— the shared slash-command catalog (a single source for repl and serve/web)."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:5 of
msgid ""
"repl 输入框与 web 输入框都以 ``/cmd [arg]`` 形式接受控制命令。本模块承载 "
"命令的**单一逻辑源**（返回文本行），两端只是不同渲染： - repl：对 ``slash_lines(...)`` 返回的行逐行 "
"``print``（并自行处理改变前台"
msgstr ""
"Both the repl input box and the web input box accept control commands in ``/cmd [arg]`` form. This module hosts the "
"**single logic source** of the commands (returning text lines); the two ends are just different renderings: - repl: ``print`` the lines returned by ``slash_lines(...)`` line by line (and handle the foreground-"

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:8 of
msgid "绑定的 ``/exit /quit /agent /new`` 与会话级生命周期）；"
msgstr "binding-changing ``/exit /quit /agent /new`` and the session-level lifecycle itself);"

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:9 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"serve ``POST /agents/{id}/command``：把 ``slash_lines`` 返回的行回成 JSON， 供 web "
"用任意聚焦 agent 执行任意 repl 指令。"
msgstr ""
"serve ``POST /agents/{id}/command``: returns the lines produced by ``slash_lines`` as JSON, letting the web "
"execute any repl instruction with any focused agent."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:12 of
msgid ""
"命令按目标分为两类： - **runtime 级**（不需 agent）：``help / agents / snapshot``； - "
"**agent 级**（作用于给定 agent）：``messages / model / status / tasks /"
msgstr ""
"Commands fall into two categories by target: - **runtime level** (no agent needed): ``help / agents / snapshot``; - "
"**agent level** (acting on a given agent): ``messages / model / status / tasks /"

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:15 of
msgid "export / rewind / cancel / pause / resume``。"
msgstr "export / rewind / cancel / pause / resume``."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:17 of
msgid ""
"约定：本目录只含“作用于显式目标并返回文本”的命令；前台绑定切换（``agent``/ ``new``）与进程退出（``exit / "
"quit``）是交互壳自身行为，不在此列。"
msgstr ""
"Convention: this catalog only contains commands that \"act on an explicit target and return text\"; foreground binding switching (``agent`` / ``new``) and process exit (``exit / "
"quit``) are behaviors of the interactive shell itself and are not listed here."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls:22 of
msgid ""
"``flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`` ``flowing.interfaces.serve`` ``POST "
"/agents/<id>/command``"
msgstr ""
"``flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`` ``flowing.interfaces.serve`` ``POST "
"/agents/<id>/command``"

#: flowing.interfaces.controls.HELP_LINES:1 of
msgid "命令的一句话说明（/help 用；与 repl ``SLASH_COMMANDS`` 一一对应）。"
msgstr "One-line description of each command (for /help; corresponds one-to-one with the repl ``SLASH_COMMANDS``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls.slash_lines:1 of
msgid "执行一个 slash 命令，返回应展示的文本行（纯函数式：不直接 print）。"
msgstr "Executes one slash command and returns the text lines to display (purely functional: never prints directly)."

#: flowing.interfaces.controls.slash_lines:3 of
msgid ""
"带前导 ``/`` 的 ``cmd`` 会被剥成命令名；``arg`` 为第一个空格之后的 参数串（可再切子命令）。不识别 / 需绑定 agent"
" 的命令而无 agent 时返回 提示行而非抛错。"
msgstr ""
"A ``cmd`` with a leading ``/`` is stripped down to the command name; ``arg`` is the argument string after the first "
"space (it may itself be split into a subcommand). Unrecognized commands, or commands that need a bound agent"
" when none is bound, return a hint line instead of raising."

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:29
msgid "flowing.interfaces.repl module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.repl module"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.repl`` —— 交互式 REPL 子命令（``repl`` / 别名 ``cli``）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.repl`` —— the interactive REPL subcommand (``repl`` / alias ``cli``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl:3 of
msgid "封闭观察窗口原则见 ``flowing.interfaces`` 包 docstring。"
msgstr "The closed-observation-window principle is documented in the ``flowing.interfaces`` package docstring."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:1 of
msgid ""
"repl 内 slash-command 的封闭集合：以 ``/`` 开头的输入是控制命令， 不是发给 LLM 的消息。固定集合保证默认 repl"
" 这个冷启动观察窗口的 行为可预测，不接受运行时注册新命令。"
msgstr ""
"The closed set of slash-commands inside the repl: input starting with ``/`` is a control command, not a message sent to the LLM. The fixed set keeps the behavior of the default repl"
" — a cold-start observation window — predictable, and runtime registration of new commands is not accepted."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:5 of
msgid "行为要点："
msgstr "Key behaviors:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:7 of
msgid "``/help``：列出本集合的全部命令及一句话说明。"
msgstr "``/help``: lists all commands of this set with one-line descriptions."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:8 of
msgid "``/exit``：退出 repl（触发 ``runtime.shutdown()`` 后以 :data:`EXIT_OK` 退出进程）。"
msgstr "``/exit``: exits the repl (triggers ``runtime.shutdown()`` and then exits the process with :data:`EXIT_OK`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:10 of
msgid "``/quit``：``/exit`` 的别名，行为完全相同。"
msgstr "``/quit``: an alias of ``/exit`` with identical behavior."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:11 of
msgid "``/snapshot``：打印当前 Runtime 只读快照（``runtime.snapshot()`` 的人类可读渲染）。"
msgstr "``/snapshot``: prints a read-only snapshot of the current Runtime (a human-readable rendering of ``runtime.snapshot()``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:13 of
msgid "``/messages``：打印当前绑定 Agent 的消息级树摘要（沿 ``current_head_id`` 上溯；未绑定时打印提示）。"
msgstr "``/messages``: prints a summary of the bound Agent's message-level tree (walking up along ``current_head_id``; prints a hint when unbound)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:15 of
msgid ""
"``/agents``：列出有记录的 Agent（``agent_id``、最后一次回复前缀、 最后修改时间；数据源与懒读规则见 "
":func:`cmd_repl`）。"
msgstr ""
"``/agents``: lists the recorded Agents (``agent_id``, prefix of the last reply, last-modified time; see "
":func:`cmd_repl` for the data source and lazy-reading rules)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:17 of
msgid ""
"``/agent <id>``：切换绑定目标（未激活 id 经 :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_agent`"
" 现场恢复；未知 id 提示， 绑定不变）。其余命令（``messages`` / ``model`` / ``status`` / "
"``tasks`` / ``export`` / ``rewind`` / ``cancel`` / ``pause`` / "
"``resume``）经 ``slash_lines`` 执行，语义见 :mod:`flowing.interfaces.controls`。"
msgstr ""
"``/agent <id>``: switches the binding target (an inactive id is restored on the spot via :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_agent`"
"; an unknown id prints a hint and the binding stays unchanged). The remaining commands (``messages`` / ``model`` / ``status`` / "
"``tasks`` / ``export`` / ``rewind`` / ``cancel`` / ``pause`` / "
"``resume``) are executed via ``slash_lines``; see :mod:`flowing.interfaces.controls` for their semantics."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:24 of
msgid "未识别的 ``/xxx`` 输入：打印“未知命令，/help 查看可用命令”， 不报错、不退出、不进消息流。带参命令按第一个空格分流参数。"
msgstr "Unrecognized ``/xxx`` input: prints \"unknown command, use /help to see available commands\" — no error, no exit, and it never enters the message stream. For commands with arguments, the argument is split off at the first space."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.SLASH_COMMANDS:27 of
msgid ":func:`cmd_repl`、:meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`"
msgstr ":func:`cmd_repl`, :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:1 of
msgid "``flowing repl <path>`` （别名 ``flowing cli``）：交互式 REPL。"
msgstr "``flowing repl <path>`` (alias ``flowing cli``): the interactive REPL."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:5 of
msgid ""
"在 ``run`` 之上加一个交互壳：从 stdin 读行、按 ``/`` 前缀分流 （slash-command vs USER 消息）、打印 "
"Agent 回复。"
msgstr ""
"Adds an interactive shell on top of ``run``: reads lines from stdin, routes by the ``/`` prefix (slash-command vs USER message), and prints "
"Agent replies."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:8 of
msgid "repl 内部有会话内绑定状态："
msgstr "The repl maintains an in-session binding state:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:10 of
msgid "已绑定：非 ``/`` 输入投递给当前 Agent；提示符为 ``(<agent_id>)>>>``。"
msgstr "Bound: non-``/`` input is delivered to the current Agent; the prompt is ``(<agent_id>)>>>``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:12 of
msgid ""
"未绑定：提示符为 ``(new agent)>>>``；非 ``/`` 输入先创建新 Agent（类型来源见行为要点第 3 "
"步）并绑定、再投递；``/agents`` 列出有记录的 Agent，``/use <agent_id>`` 切换绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Unbound: the prompt is ``(new agent)>>>``; non-``/`` input first creates a new Agent (see Key Behaviors step 3 for the type source) "
"and binds it, then is delivered; ``/agents`` lists the recorded Agents and ``/use <agent_id>`` switches the binding."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:16 of
msgid ""
"多根项目不在启动时报错退出，而是进入未绑定状态由用户现场选择； Workflow 根天然不参与绑定候选。新建 vs 恢复是子项目 "
"``main()`` 的项目级策略（``launch`` 契约），repl 只在 ``main`` 产物之上做 会话内绑定。"
msgstr ""
"A multi-root project does not exit with an error at startup; instead it enters the unbound state and lets the user choose on the spot. Workflow roots never participate in binding candidates. Create-new vs. resume is a project-level policy of the subproject "
"``main()`` (part of the ``launch`` contract); the repl only performs in-session binding on top of what ``main`` produced."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:36 of
msgid ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` 拿 Runtime"
" 并安装信号处理器；``launch`` 抛异常时向 stderr 打印 异常摘要，返回 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` obtains the Runtime"
" and installs the signal handlers; if ``launch`` raises, an exception summary is printed to stderr and :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` is returned."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:39 of
msgid ""
"启动绑定：先扫已激活根 Agent，恰好一个则绑定；没有激活根时， 池中未激活根条目恰好一个 → ``await "
"runtime.get_agent(agent_id)`` 现场恢复并绑定（身份连续）；零个或多个 → 未绑定（有记录时 打印 "
"``/agents`` 提示）。"
msgstr ""
"Startup binding: first scan the already-active root Agents — if exactly one, bind it; if none is active and the pool has exactly one inactive root entry → ``await "
"runtime.get_agent(agent_id)`` restores it on the spot and binds it (identity continuity); zero or multiple → unbound (a "
"``/agents`` hint is printed when records exist)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:43 of
msgid "读行循环。提示符：已绑定 ``(<agent_id>)>>>``，未绑定 ``(new agent)>>>``。输入分两类："
msgstr "The line-reading loop. Prompt: ``(<agent_id>)>>>`` when bound, ``(new agent)>>>`` when unbound. Input falls into two categories:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:46 of
msgid ""
"非 ``/`` 开头：未绑定则先创建新 Agent——``agent_type`` 取 池中根条目里 ``created_at`` 最新者的 "
"``agent_type`` （:func:`_default_agent_type`，与 serve ``POST /agents`` "
"缺省类型同口径）；池无根条目 → 打印“无法确定 Agent 类型” 提示，不创建。创建经 "
"``runtime.create_agent(agent_type)`` （``parent_id=None`` 缺省即根）并绑定。然后以 "
"``str`` 调 :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query` （打包 USER 消息在其内部 "
"完成），等待回合结果（``TurnResult``），打印最终文本，再 显示下一个提示符。"
msgstr ""
"Not starting with ``/``: if unbound, a new Agent is created first — ``agent_type`` is taken from the ``agent_type`` of the root pool entry with the newest ``created_at`` "
"(:func:`_default_agent_type`, the same criterion as the default type of serve ``POST /agents``); "
"if the pool has no root entries → print a \"cannot determine the Agent type\" hint and do not create. Creation goes through "
"``runtime.create_agent(agent_type)`` (``parent_id=None`` by default, i.e. a root) and is then bound. Then "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query` is called with a ``str`` (packing the USER message happens inside "
"it), the turn result (``TurnResult``) is awaited, the final text is printed, and the next prompt is shown."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:55 of
msgid ""
"``/`` 开头：按 :data:`SLASH_COMMANDS` 解释，不进消息流； 带参命令按第一个空格分流参数。"
msgstr ""
"Starting with ``/``: interpreted per :data:`SLASH_COMMANDS` and never enters the message stream; for commands with arguments, the argument is split off at the first space."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:57 of
msgid ""
"过程显示（绑定期间生效，``/use`` 切换时订阅随之迁移）：订阅 该 Agent 的 "
"``on_provider_delta``——流式打印生成中的文本； ``after_turn_append``——新挂树的 TOOL 消息与 "
"STEER 注入消息 打印一行摘要（正文默认折叠）；``after_turn``——非 repl 的 ``query()`` 驱动的回合（cron"
" / comm 等触发源）收尾后打印最终 文本。多轮推理（ThinkingBlock）在摘要行中可见。"
msgstr ""
"Progress display (active while bound; the subscription migrates when ``/use`` switches): subscribing to the Agent's "
"``on_provider_delta`` streams the text being generated; ``after_turn_append`` prints a one-line summary for TOOL messages newly attached to the tree and for "
"STEER-injected messages (bodies are folded by default); ``after_turn`` prints the final text when a turn driven by a non-repl ``query()`` (triggered by cron"
" / comm, etc.) finishes. Multi-round reasoning (ThinkingBlock) is visible in the summary lines."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:63 of
msgid ""
"``/exit``、``/quit`` 或 EOF（Ctrl-D）→ ``runtime.shutdown()`` → 返回 "
":data:`EXIT_OK`。"
msgstr ""
"``/exit``, ``/quit``, or EOF (Ctrl-D) → ``runtime.shutdown()`` → return "
":data:`EXIT_OK`."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:66 of
msgid "slash-command 语义："
msgstr "Slash-command semantics:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:68 of
msgid ""
"``/agents``：列出池名录全部 Agent（含休眠记录）——每行 ``agent_id``、最后一次回复前缀、最后修改时间。名录来自池注册"
" 表；最后回复前缀懒读各 Agent session 目录 ``tree.jsonl`` 尾部 最后一条 PROVIDER 消息的文本前缀（未激活"
" Agent 没有内存对象， 只能读盘；前缀不回写池元数据）。"
msgstr ""
"``/agents``: lists all Agents in the pool registry (including dormant records) — each line shows ``agent_id``, the prefix of the last reply, and the last-modified time. The registry comes from the pool registry"
"; the last-reply prefix is lazily read from the tail of each Agent's session-directory ``tree.jsonl``, namely the text prefix of the last PROVIDER message (an inactive"
" Agent has no in-memory object, so only the disk can be read; the prefix is not written back into pool metadata)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:73 of
msgid ""
"``/use <agent_id>``：切换绑定目标。id 命中激活实例或池名录 → ``await "
"runtime.get_agent(agent_id)`` （已激活直接返回，否则 走恢复管线现场恢复）；未知 id → "
"打印提示，绑定不变。只换投递 目标，不 destroy 原 Agent（保持激活）。"
msgstr ""
"``/use <agent_id>``: switches the binding target. An id that hits an active instance or a pool-registry entry → ``await "
"runtime.get_agent(agent_id)`` (returns directly if already active, otherwise restores on the spot through "
"the recovery pipeline); an unknown id → print a hint and leave the binding unchanged. Only the delivery "
"target changes — the original Agent is not destroyed (it stays active)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:77 of
msgid "``/messages``：未绑定 → 打印提示（无会话可看）。"
msgstr "``/messages``: when unbound → print a hint (there is no session to view)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:79 of
msgid "扩展注入点（供 ``repl-debug`` 等继承者使用；默认 ``repl`` 不传）："
msgstr "Extension injection points (for inheritors such as ``repl-debug``; the default ``repl`` does not pass them):"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:81 of
msgid ""
"``extra_slash_handlers``：在已识别 slash-command 之后、未知 命令之前被调用；handler 签名 "
"``async (arg: str, agent: Agent | None, runtime: Runtime) -> None``。"
msgstr ""
"``extra_slash_handlers``: called after the recognized slash-commands and before unknown-command handling; the handler signature is "
"``async (arg: str, agent: Agent | None, runtime: Runtime) -> None``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:84 of
msgid ""
"``pre_prompt_hook``：每次打印提示符之前调用；签名 ``async (agent: Agent | None, runtime:"
" Runtime) -> None``。"
msgstr ""
"``pre_prompt_hook``: called before each prompt is printed; the signature is ``async (agent: Agent | None, runtime:"
" Runtime) -> None``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:86 of
msgid "``extra_help_text``：追加到 ``/help`` 输出末尾。"
msgstr "``extra_help_text``: appended to the end of the ``/help`` output."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:87 of
msgid "这三个注入点都不得改变绑定状态或消息流。"
msgstr "None of these three injection points may change the binding state or the message stream."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:89 flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:27 of
msgid "边界与边缘情况："
msgstr "Boundaries and edge cases:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:91 of
msgid "空行输入跳过，不投递。"
msgstr "Empty-line input is skipped and not delivered."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:92 of
msgid ""
"行编辑与补全（``readline`` 可用时）：方向键 / 行编辑 / 会话内历史 由 ``input()`` 天然获得；Tab 补全顶层 "
"slash 命令（仅行首 ``/`` 开头的词，参数不补全）。"
msgstr ""
"Line editing and completion (when ``readline`` is available): arrow keys / line editing / in-session history come naturally from ``input()``; Tab completes top-level "
"slash commands (only the ``/``-prefixed word at line start — arguments are not completed)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:95 of
msgid "未绑定时收到非 ``/`` 输入且池无根条目：打印“无法确定 Agent 类型”提示，名录保持为空，不退出。"
msgstr "Receiving non-``/`` input while unbound with no root entries in the pool: print the \"cannot determine the Agent type\" hint, keep the registry empty, and do not exit."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:97 of
msgid "未识别的 ``/xxx``：打印“未知命令，/help 查看可用命令”， 继续循环。"
msgstr "Unrecognized ``/xxx``: print \"unknown command, use /help to see available commands\" and continue the loop."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:99 of
msgid ""
"回合进行中收到 SIGINT（Ctrl-C）：repl 专用处理器对当前绑定 Agent "
"``abort_turn()``——协作式取消当轮（回合以 cancelled 收尾），repl 与 会话存活；提示符空闲时 SIGINT "
"中断当前输入行（换行重提示，不退出）。 SIGTERM 走优雅关闭桥（``runtime.shutdown()``）。"
msgstr ""
"SIGINT (Ctrl-C) received mid-turn: the repl-specific handler calls ``abort_turn()`` on the currently bound Agent "
"— cooperatively canceling the current turn (the turn ends as cancelled) while the repl and the session stay alive; at an idle prompt, SIGINT "
"interrupts the current input line (re-prompt on a new line, no exit). SIGTERM goes through the graceful-shutdown bridge (``runtime.shutdown()``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:103 of
msgid "``query()`` 返回 ``status=\"error\"`` 的 ``TurnResult``：照常 打印错误文本，repl 不因此退出。"
msgstr "A ``TurnResult`` with ``status=\"error\"`` returned by ``query()``: the error text is printed as usual and the repl does not exit because of it."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:105 of
msgid "``/use`` 或启动绑定恢复失败（记录损坏）：打印错误，绑定不变， 可再经 ``/agents`` + ``/use`` 现场选择。"
msgstr "``/use`` or startup-binding recovery failure (corrupted record): print the error, leave the binding unchanged; the user can still choose on the spot via ``/agents`` + ``/use``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:108 of
msgid "子项目路径（同 :func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`）。"
msgstr "The subproject path (same as :func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:109
#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:9
