msgstr "An alternative entry main file (optional, passed in via the CLI ``-m``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:110 of
msgid "附加 slash-command 表（命令名 → 异步 handler），默认 ``None`` （不启用）。"
msgstr "An additional slash-command table (command name → async handler), default ``None`` (disabled)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:112 of
msgid "每次打印提示符前调用的异步钩子，默认 ``None``。"
msgstr "An async hook called before each prompt is printed, default ``None``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:114 of
msgid "追加到 ``/help`` 输出末尾的文本，默认 ``None``。"
msgstr "Text appended to the end of the ``/help`` output, default ``None``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl:116
#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:10
