#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:37
msgid "flowing.interfaces.repl\\_debug module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.repl\\_debug module"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.repl_debug`` —— 调试扩展版 REPL 子命令（``repl-debug``）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.repl_debug`` —— the debug-extended REPL subcommand (``repl-debug``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:5 of
msgid ""
"``flowing repl-debug <path>`` 是 :func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl` "
"的调试扩展版：继承 ``repl`` 的全部行为（启动绑定、提示符、非 ``/`` 输入投递、既有 7 个 slash-command、EOF /"
" ``/exit`` 退出），额外提供 4 个调试 slash-command：``/eval``、``/watch``、``/eval-"
"runtime``、 ``/watch-runtime``。默认 ``repl`` 的封闭 slash-command 集合不变—— 调试命令只在"
" ``repl-debug`` 中启用。"
msgstr ""
"``flowing repl-debug <path>`` is a debug-extended variant of :func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`"
": it inherits all of ``repl``'s behavior (startup binding, prompts, non-``/`` input delivery, the existing 7 slash-commands, EOF /"
" ``/exit`` exit), and additionally provides 4 debug slash-commands: ``/eval``, ``/watch``, ``/eval-"
"runtime``, and ``/watch-runtime``. The default ``repl``'s closed slash-command set is unchanged — the debug commands are only enabled in"
" ``repl-debug``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:12 of
msgid ""
"实现方式是利用 ``cmd_repl`` 的扩展注入点（``extra_slash_handlers`` / "
"``pre_prompt_hook`` / ``extra_help_text``）；默认 ``repl`` 不传这些 注入点，行为完全不变。默认"
" ``repl`` 的 ``/help`` 不列出调试命令； ``repl-debug`` 的 ``/help`` 额外列出这 4 个命令。"
msgstr ""
"The implementation uses ``cmd_repl``'s extension injection points (``extra_slash_handlers`` / "
"``pre_prompt_hook`` / ``extra_help_text``); the default ``repl`` passes none of these injection points, so its behavior is completely unchanged. The default"
" ``repl``'s ``/help`` does not list the debug commands; ``repl-debug``'s ``/help`` additionally lists these 4 commands."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:18 of
msgid "命令语法"
msgstr "Command Syntax"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:23 of
msgid "命令"
msgstr "Command"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:24 of
msgid "语法"
msgstr "Syntax"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:25 of
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:26 of
msgid "``/eval <expr>``"
msgstr "``/eval <expr>``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:27 of
msgid "``/eval current_mode``"
msgstr "``/eval current_mode``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:28 of
msgid "以当前绑定 Agent 为上下文解析并打印表达式"
msgstr "Resolves and prints the expression with the currently bound Agent as context"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:29 of
msgid "``/watch <expr>``"
msgstr "``/watch <expr>``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:30 of
msgid "``/watch current_mode``"
msgstr "``/watch current_mode``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:31 of
msgid "以当前绑定 Agent 为上下文解析并加入监视"
msgstr "Resolves the expression with the currently bound Agent as context and adds it to the watch list"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:32 of
msgid "``/eval-runtime <expr>``"
msgstr "``/eval-runtime <expr>``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:33 of
msgid "``/eval-runtime self.snapshot().plugins``"
msgstr "``/eval-runtime self.snapshot().plugins``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:34 of
msgid "以 Runtime 为上下文解析并打印表达式"
msgstr "Resolves and prints the expression with the Runtime as context"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:35 of
msgid "``/watch-runtime <expr>``"
msgstr "``/watch-runtime <expr>``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:36 of
msgid "``/watch-runtime self.snapshot().agents``"
msgstr "``/watch-runtime self.snapshot().agents``"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:37 of
msgid "以 Runtime 为上下文解析并加入监视"
msgstr "Resolves the expression with the Runtime as context and adds it to the watch list"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:39 of
msgid ""
"``<expr>`` 是 Jinja2 表达式体，不需要写外层 ``{{ }}``；本命令包装为 ``{{ <expr> }}`` "
"后求值。``<expr>`` 为空时打印该命令的用法提示，不 执行。"
msgstr ""
"``<expr>`` is a Jinja2 expression body — the outer ``{{ }}`` is not written; this command wraps it as ``{{ <expr> }}`` "
"before evaluation. When ``<expr>`` is empty, the command's usage hint is printed and nothing is executed."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:44 of
msgid "解析上下文"
msgstr "Resolution Contexts"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:45 of
msgid "Agent 上下文（``/eval``、``/watch``）："
msgstr "Agent context (``/eval``, ``/watch``):"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:47 of
msgid "必须存在当前绑定 Agent；未绑定（提示符 ``(new agent)>>>``）时打印 “未绑定 Agent：无法解析表达式”。"
msgstr "A currently bound Agent must exist; when unbound (prompt ``(new agent)>>>``), it prints \"no bound Agent: cannot resolve the expression\"."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:49 of
msgid ""
"有绑定时，求值经 ``agent.parsable(\"{{ <expr> }}\").resolve(agent)``， 与 flowing "
"其它 ``Parsable`` 求值共用同一套上下文语义（``env`` / ``config`` / 实例属性 / Parsable 字段等）。"
msgstr ""
"When bound, evaluation goes through ``agent.parsable(\"{{ <expr> }}\").resolve(agent)``, sharing the same context semantics as all other ``Parsable`` evaluations in flowing "
"(``env`` / ``config`` / instance attributes / Parsable fields, etc.)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:52 of
msgid "绑定切换（``/use <id>``）后，Agent 上下文改用新绑定 Agent。"
msgstr "After a binding switch (``/use <id>``), the Agent context switches to the newly bound Agent."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:54 of
msgid "Runtime 上下文（``/eval-runtime``、``/watch-runtime``）："
msgstr "Runtime context (``/eval-runtime``, ``/watch-runtime``):"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:56 of
msgid "上下文是 Runtime 实例，变量名必须是 ``self`` （``self = runtime``）。"
msgstr "The context is the Runtime instance; the variable name must be ``self`` (``self = runtime``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:57 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"求值经 ``Parsable(\"{{ <expr> }}\").resolve({\"self\": runtime})``， 表达式里的 "
"``self`` 与 ``agent`` 都可引用 Runtime。"
msgstr ""
"Evaluation goes through ``Parsable(\"{{ <expr> }}\").resolve({\"self\": runtime})``; both ``self`` and ``agent`` in the expression "
"can refer to the Runtime."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:59 of
msgid "不依赖当前是否绑定 Agent；未绑定也能执行。"
msgstr "It does not depend on whether an Agent is currently bound; it works even when unbound."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:62 of
msgid "错误处理"
msgstr "Error Handling"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:63 of
msgid ""
"求值抛出任何异常时原样打印异常（``print(str(exception))``）：不 包装、不改写、不追加 "
"traceback；进程不退出，回到当前提示符。"
msgstr ""
"When evaluation raises any exception, the exception is printed as-is (``print(str(exception))``): no wrapping, no rewriting, no "
"traceback appended; the process does not exit and returns to the current prompt."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:65 of
msgid "未绑定 Agent 时 ``/eval``、``/watch`` 打印上述特殊提示，不进入 求值。"
msgstr "When no Agent is bound, ``/eval`` and ``/watch`` print the special hint above and never enter evaluation."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:70 of
msgid "``/eval``：立即求值一次并打印结果（``print(value)``）；不记录、不 加入 watch。"
msgstr "``/eval``: evaluates once immediately and prints the result (``print(value)``); nothing is recorded or added to the watch list."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:73 of
msgid "``/watch``："
msgstr "``/watch``:"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:75 of
msgid ""
"首次执行：立即求值一次，打印 ``[watch] <expr> => <value>``，并把 ``(expr, 最后值)`` 加入当前绑定 "
"Agent 的 watch 列表。"
msgstr ""
"First execution: evaluates once immediately, prints ``[watch] <expr> => <value>``, and adds ``(expr, last value)`` to the currently bound "
"Agent's watch list."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:77 of
msgid ""
"之后每次 REPL 循环打印下一个提示符之前，对 watch 列表逐条重新 求值：值未变不打印；值变化打印 ``[watch] <expr> =>"
" <new value>``； 求值报错按错误处理规则打印错误，并保留该 watch（下次继续尝试）。"
msgstr ""
"Thereafter, before the REPL loop prints each next prompt, every watch-list entry is re-evaluated: unchanged values are not printed; a changed value prints ``[watch] <expr> =>"
" <new value>``; an evaluation error is printed per the error-handling rules and the watch is kept (it will be tried again next time)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:80 of
msgid "值比较使用 ``!=``。"
msgstr "Value comparison uses ``!=``."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:81 of
msgid "绑定 Agent 切换后，Agent watch 改用新绑定 Agent；退出 / EOF 时 watch 随进程消失，不持久化。"
msgstr "After the bound Agent switches, Agent watches switch to the newly bound Agent; on exit / EOF the watches disappear with the process and are not persisted."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:84 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``/eval-runtime`` / ``/watch-runtime``：与 ``/eval`` / ``/watch`` 相同，只是上下文为"
" ``{\"self\": runtime}``；Runtime watch 不依赖绑定 状态，绑定切换不影响它。"
msgstr ""
"``/eval-runtime`` / ``/watch-runtime``: same as ``/eval`` / ``/watch``, except the context is"
" ``{\"self\": runtime}``; Runtime watches do not depend on the binding state and are unaffected by binding switches."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug:88 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`、:func:`cmd_repl_debug`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`, :func:`cmd_repl_debug`"

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:1 of
msgid "``flowing repl-debug <path>``：继承 ``repl`` 并附加调试表达式命令。"
msgstr "``flowing repl-debug <path>``: inherits ``repl`` and adds debug-expression commands."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:3 of
msgid ""
"构造 4 个调试命令的 handler、watch 状态与提示前检查钩子，然后 委托 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl` （经其扩展注入点 传入）。命令语义见本模块 docstring。"
msgstr ""
"Builds the handlers for the 4 debug commands, the watch state, and the pre-prompt check hook, then delegates to "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl` (passed in via its extension injection points). See this module's docstring for the command semantics."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:7 of
msgid "子项目路径（同 :func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`）。"
msgstr "The subproject path (same as :func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:12 of
msgid "委托 ``cmd_repl`` 得到的退出码（:data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`）。"
msgstr "The exit code obtained by delegating to ``cmd_repl`` (:data:`EXIT_OK` / :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.repl_debug.cmd_repl_debug:15 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.repl.cmd_repl`"

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:45
msgid "flowing.interfaces.run module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.run module"

#: flowing.interfaces.run:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.run`` —— 一次性执行（``run``）与冒烟测试（``test``）子命令。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.run`` —— the one-shot execution (``run``) and smoke test (``test``) subcommands."

#: flowing.interfaces.run:3 of
msgid "退出码约定见 ``flowing.interfaces`` 包 docstring。"
msgstr "The exit-code conventions are documented in the ``flowing.interfaces`` package docstring."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:1 of
msgid "``flowing run <path>``：launch 后 ``await runtime``，长驻进程。"
msgstr "``flowing run <path>``: ``await runtime`` after launch — a long-running process."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:5 of
msgid ""
"最朴素的长驻形态：拉起子项目后阻塞在 ``await runtime`` 上，等待 消息（来自 Cron、通信扩展、嵌入方等任意 "
"``enqueue_message()`` 来源）与关闭信号。``repl`` 与 ``serve`` 都是在本形态之上加交互 层或 HTTP "
"骨架。"
msgstr ""
"The plainest long-running form: after starting the subproject it blocks on ``await runtime``, waiting for messages (from any "
"``enqueue_message()`` source such as Cron, communication extensions, or embedders) and for shutdown signals. ``repl`` and ``serve`` are both this form plus an interaction "
"layer or an HTTP skeleton on top."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:18 of
msgid ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` ——登记 "
"``@`` 上下文、import 子项目入口 main 文件（缺省 ``@/main.py``，经 CLI ``-m`` 指定）、执行 "
"``main``。返回时 Agent 已激活、消息级树与队列已就绪，逻辑 Turn 循环挂起等待 消息。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` — registers "
"the ``@`` context, imports the subproject entry main file (default ``@/main.py``, overridable via the CLI ``-m``), and executes "
"``main``. On return the Agents are active, the message-level tree and queues are ready, and the logical Turn loop is suspended waiting for messages."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:23 of
msgid "安装 SIGINT / SIGTERM 信号处理器（:func:`_install_signal_handlers`）。"
msgstr "Installs the SIGINT / SIGTERM signal handlers (:func:`_install_signal_handlers`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:24 of
msgid "``await runtime`` 阻塞直到 shutdown。"
msgstr "``await runtime`` blocks until shutdown."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:25 of
msgid "唤醒后返回 :data:`EXIT_OK`。"
msgstr "After waking up, returns :data:`EXIT_OK`."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:29 of
msgid "不从 stdin 读任何输入（要交互用 ``repl``）。"
msgstr "Reads nothing from stdin (use ``repl`` for interaction)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:30 of
msgid ""
"子项目未 ``mount`` （无默认节点形态）：完全合法，Runtime 空转， ``await runtime`` 依然只等 shutdown"
" 事件。"
msgstr ""
"A subproject without ``mount`` (no default node form): fully legal — the Runtime idles and ``await runtime`` still only waits for the shutdown"
" event."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:32 of
msgid "``launch`` 抛异常：异常摘要打印到 stderr，返回 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`，进程不再等待信号。"
msgstr "If ``launch`` raises: the exception summary is printed to stderr, :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` is returned, and the process no longer waits for signals."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:35 flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:49
#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:106 flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:37 of
msgid "子项目路径（普通文件系统路径）。"
msgstr "The subproject path (an ordinary filesystem path)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:39 of
msgid ":data:`EXIT_OK` （正常关闭）或 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` （``launch`` 失败）。"
msgstr ":data:`EXIT_OK` (normal shutdown) or :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` (``launch`` failed)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run:44 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`、:meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown` "
":func:`_install_signal_handlers` —— 信号到 shutdown 的桥接。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`, :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.shutdown` "
":func:`_install_signal_handlers` —— the bridge from signals to shutdown."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:1 of
msgid "``flowing test <path>``：拉起即断言，随后停。"
msgstr "``flowing test <path>``: start up, assert immediately, then stop."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:5 of
msgid ""
"``test`` 子命令的职责是冒烟拉起：``launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` "
"（``-m`` 可指定替代入口文件，如 冒烟专用 ``main_test.py``）成功后取一次 ``runtime.snapshot()`` "
"验证可观测面就绪，随后 ``runtime.shutdown()`` 并返回 :data:`EXIT_OK`；``launch`` "
"或快照断言失败返回 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`。"
msgstr ""
"The ``test`` subcommand's job is a smoke startup: after ``launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)`` "
"succeeds (``-m`` can specify an alternative entry file, such as a smoke-test-only ``main_test.py``), it takes one ``runtime.snapshot()`` "
"to verify the observable surface is ready, then calls ``runtime.shutdown()`` and returns :data:`EXIT_OK`; a ``launch`` "
"or snapshot-assertion failure returns :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:12 of
msgid ""
"“拿 Runtime 做断言后停”中断言什么（项目级行为断言）是子项目的 策略，不是框架机制：由用户经嵌入 API 自行编写（``launch``"
" + ``query()`` + ``snapshot()``，放进 pytest 等任意测试框架）。 ``test`` "
"子命令只提供零配置的“项目能否拉起”冒烟检查。"
msgstr ""
"What to assert in \"get the Runtime, assert, then stop\" (project-level behavior assertions) is the subproject's policy, not a framework mechanism: users write it themselves via the embedding API (``launch``"
" + ``query()`` + ``snapshot()``, inside any test framework such as pytest). The ``test`` "
"subcommand only provides the zero-configuration \"can the project start up\" smoke check."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:24 of
msgid "项目级断言（用户自写，不经 ``flowing test``）："
msgstr "Project-level assertions (user-written, not via ``flowing test``):"

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:37 of
msgid ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)``； "
"``launch`` 失败（``main`` 抛异常、项目不可 import 等）→ 向 stderr 打印异常摘要，返回 "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)``; a ``launch`` failure (``main`` raised, the project "
"cannot be imported, etc.) → print an exception summary to stderr and return "
":data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:40 of
msgid "``snap = runtime.snapshot()``；冒烟断言口径：快照调用不抛异常 且结果可 JSON 序列化即通过，不断言业务字段。"
msgstr "``snap = runtime.snapshot()``; the smoke-assertion criterion: the snapshot call does not raise and the result is JSON-serializable — business fields are not asserted."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:42 of
msgid ""
"``await runtime.shutdown()`` 完整关闭后返回 :data:`EXIT_OK`；快照断言失败仍尝试 shutdown "
"后再退出。"
msgstr ""
"After a full ``await runtime.shutdown()``, returns :data:`EXIT_OK`; even if the snapshot assertion fails, shutdown "
"is still attempted before exiting."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:45 of
msgid ""
"边界：不发现 / 不执行项目里的测试文件；不 mock LLM（项目拉起不 要求真实 Provider 可用——懒创建保证未调用的 "
"Provider 不产生网络 活动）。"
msgstr ""
"Boundaries: it neither discovers nor executes test files in the project; it does not mock the LLM (starting the project does not require a real Provider to be available — lazy creation guarantees that an uncalled "
"Provider produces no network activity)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:53 of
msgid ""
":data:`EXIT_OK` （拉起成功并正常关闭）或 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` （``launch`` "
"或快照断言失败）。"
msgstr ""
":data:`EXIT_OK` (started up successfully and shut down normally) or :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` (``launch`` "
"or snapshot-assertion failure)."

#: flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_test:58 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`、 :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`、"
" :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query`"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.runtime.launch`, :meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`,"
" :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query`"

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:53
msgid "flowing.interfaces.serve module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.serve module"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve:1 of
msgid "``flowing.interfaces.serve`` —— HTTP API 服务子命令（``serve``，纯 API 无前端）。"
msgstr "``flowing.interfaces.serve`` —— the HTTP API service subcommand (``serve``, pure API, no frontend)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve:3 of
msgid "参数分层、退出码与信号处理的总约定见 ``flowing.interfaces`` 包 docstring。"
msgstr "The overall conventions for argument layering, exit codes, and signal handling are documented in the ``flowing.interfaces`` package docstring."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:1 of
msgid ""
"默认 serve 暴露的 HTTP 端点封闭集（共 :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` 所列条数）： serve 是纯 API "
"的冷启动 观察窗口，固定端点集保证行为可预测，不接受开放注册任意 endpoint； 集合之外的任何路径返回 ``404``。"
msgstr ""
"The closed set of HTTP endpoints exposed by the default serve (as many entries as :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` lists): serve is a pure-API cold-start "
"observation window; the fixed endpoint set keeps behavior predictable, open registration of arbitrary endpoints is not accepted, and any path outside the set returns ``404``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:6 of
msgid ""
"风格约定：REST 集合资源式，集合一律复数 ``/agents``——集合 （``GET /agents`` 列出 / ``POST "
"/agents`` 创建，id 由服务端分配故创建 走 POST 集合）+ 成员（``/agents/<id>/...`` 子资源动作）。"
msgstr ""
"Style convention: REST collection-resource style, collections always plural as ``/agents`` — collection (``GET /agents`` lists / ``POST "
"/agents`` creates; since ids are server-assigned, creation POSTs to the collection) + members (``/agents/<id>/...`` sub-resource actions)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:10 of
msgid "端点语义："
msgstr "Endpoint semantics:"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:12 of
msgid ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``：向指定 Agent 投递一条 USER 消息并等待回合结果（见 "
":func:`cmd_serve` 的端点契约）。"
msgstr ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``: delivers one USER message to the specified Agent and waits for the turn result (see the endpoint contract in "
":func:`cmd_serve`)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:14 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents``：列出池名录全部 Agent（含休眠记录；每项 ``agent_id`` + 最后一次回复前缀 + "
"最后修改时间；数据源与懒读规则 同 REPL ``/agents``）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents``: lists all Agents in the pool registry (including dormant records; each entry has ``agent_id`` + last-reply prefix + "
"last-modified time; the data source and lazy-reading rules are the same as REPL ``/agents``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:17 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``POST /agents``：创建根 Agent（body ``{\"agent_type\"?: str, \"args\"?: "
"dict}``，缺省类型 = 项目默认主 Agent，同 REPL 未绑定态 发消息的隐式创建）。"
msgstr ""
"``POST /agents``: creates a root Agent (body ``{\"agent_type\"?: str, \"args\"?: "
"dict}``; the default type is the project's default primary Agent, same as the implicit creation when an unbound REPL sends a message)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:20 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/messages``：当前 head 上溯链的消息视图 （渲染对话用；休眠 id 经 "
"``get_agent`` 现场恢复后读）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/messages``: a message view of the walk-up chain from the current head (for rendering the conversation; a dormant id is restored on the spot via "
"``get_agent`` before reading)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:22 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream``：SSE 长连接（生成过程流式推送， 事件序列见 "
":func:`cmd_serve` 的端点契约）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream``: an SSE long connection (streaming push of the generation process; see the endpoint contract in "
":func:`cmd_serve` for the event sequence)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:24 of
msgid "``POST /agents/<agent-id>/cancel``：协作式取消当前回合 （``agent.cancel()``）；无活跃回合幂等。"
msgstr "``POST /agents/<agent-id>/cancel``: cooperatively cancels the current turn (``agent.cancel()``); idempotent when there is no active turn."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:26 of
msgid "``GET /snapshot``：返回 ``runtime.snapshot()`` 的 JSON 序列化， 只读、无副作用。"
msgstr "``GET /snapshot``: returns the JSON serialization of ``runtime.snapshot()`` — read-only, no side effects."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:28 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``GET /healthz``：健康检查，返回 ``{\"status\": \"ok\"}``；只表示 HTTP 进程与 Runtime "
"存活，不做深度检查。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /healthz``: health check, returns ``{\"status\": \"ok\"}``; it only indicates that the HTTP process and the Runtime "
"are alive — no deep checks."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:31 of
msgid ""
"根选取无状态：API 层没有“默认主 Agent”或“当前选中”概念——一切 目标选择由客户端基于 ``GET /agents`` / ``GET"
" /snapshot`` 自行完成， “切换 Agent”是纯客户端动作（改自己请求里的 id），无服务端对应 端点。"
msgstr ""
"Root selection is stateless: the API layer has no concept of a \"default primary Agent\" or a \"current selection\" — all target selection is done by the client itself based on ``GET /agents`` / ``GET"
" /snapshot``; \"switching Agents\" is a purely client-side action (changing the id in its own requests) with no corresponding server-side endpoint."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS:36 of
msgid ":func:`cmd_serve`、:data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS`"
msgstr ":func:`cmd_serve`, :data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS`"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:1 of
msgid "``flowing serve <path>``：把 Runtime 挂到 HTTP 服务（纯 API）。"
msgstr "``flowing serve <path>``: mounts the Runtime onto an HTTP service (pure API)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:5 of
msgid ""
"拉起 Runtime 后启动 HTTP 服务，暴露 :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` 定义的 封闭固定端点集（REST "
"复数风格：消息投递 / 列举创建 / 消息视图 / SSE 流 / 回合与模型控制 / 任务 / 导出 / 树 / help / 快照 / "
"健康检查； 完整清单以 ``GET /help`` 为权威）。无前端，供程序调用。"
msgstr ""
"Starts the HTTP service after bringing up the Runtime, exposing the closed, fixed endpoint set defined by :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` (REST "
"plural style: message delivery / list & create / message view / SSE stream / turn and model control / tasks / export / tree / help / snapshot / "
"health check; the full list is authoritative via ``GET /help``). No frontend — meant for programmatic calls."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:10 of
msgid ""
"``-a <host>`` / ``-p <port>`` 是本命令专属的 CLI 参数（在 CLI 层 剥离为 ``host`` / "
"``port``，不进入子项目 ``main`` 的 kwargs； 默认 ``127.0.0.1:8000``）。"
msgstr ""
"``-a <host>`` / ``-p <port>`` are CLI arguments specific to this command (stripped at the CLI layer into ``host`` / "
"``port``; they never enter the subproject ``main``'s kwargs; default ``127.0.0.1:8000``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:14 of
msgid ""
"HTTP 层只是消息入口之一：请求经 ``agent.query()`` （打包 + 入队 + 等待回合）与 "
"``runtime.create_agent()`` 等公开 API 与 Agent 交互， 与 CLI stdin、Cron 定时器、通信扩展的"
" peer message 完全等价。 服务进程内感知后台事件（其它 Agent 的回合、钩子触发等）经 ``agent.hooks`` 挂观察 "
"handler 实现——端点集本身不含推送通道。"
msgstr ""
"The HTTP layer is just one of the message entrances: requests interact with Agents through public APIs such as ``agent.query()`` (packing + enqueueing + awaiting the turn) and "
"``runtime.create_agent()``, exactly equivalent to CLI stdin, Cron timers, and peer messages from communication extensions. Perceiving background events inside the "
"service process (other Agents' turns, hook firings, etc.) is implemented by attaching observation handlers via ``agent.hooks`` — the endpoint set itself contains no push channel."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:45 of
msgid "时序："
msgstr "Sequence:"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:47 of
msgid ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)``， "
"安装信号处理器；``launch`` 失败 → stderr 异常摘要 + :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`。"
msgstr ""
"``runtime = await launch(path, main_file=main_file, **kwargs)``, then install the signal handlers; a ``launch`` "
"failure → an exception summary on stderr + :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR`."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:50 of
msgid ""
"绑定 ``host:port`` 并开始服务；随后 ``await runtime`` 直到 shutdown（HTTP server "
"的生命周期挂在 Runtime 上）。"
msgstr ""
"Bind ``host:port`` and start serving; then ``await runtime`` until shutdown (the HTTP server's "
"lifecycle hangs on the Runtime)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:52 of
msgid "shutdown 路径同 :func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`。"
msgstr "The shutdown path is the same as :func:`flowing.interfaces.run.cmd_run`."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:54 of
msgid "端点契约："
msgstr "Endpoint contract:"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:56 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``：请求体 ``{\"text\": str}`` → 以 ``str`` 调"
" :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query` （打包 USER 消息、 入队、等待回合结果在其内部完成）→ ``200 "
"{\"message_id\": str, \"final_text\": str}``。休眠 / 已销毁但有记录的 id 经 "
"``get_agent`` 现场恢复后投递。API 层没有“默认主 Agent”概念， 目标必须显式指定。"
msgstr ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``: request body ``{\"text\": str}`` → calls :meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query`"
" with a ``str`` (packing the USER message, enqueueing, and awaiting the turn result all happen inside it) → ``200 "
"{\"message_id\": str, \"final_text\": str}``. Dormant or destroyed-but-recorded ids are restored on the spot via "
"``get_agent`` before delivery. The API layer has no concept of a \"default primary Agent\"; the target must be specified explicitly."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:62 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents``：→ ``200``，body 为池名录全部 Agent 的列表 （含休眠记录；每项含 ``agent_id`` /"
" ``agent_type`` / ``parent_agent_id`` / ``created_at`` / ``active`` / "
"``last_reply`` / ``modified_at``；名录与懒读规则同 REPL ``/agents``）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents``: → ``200``, body is the list of all Agents in the pool registry (including dormant records; each entry contains ``agent_id`` /"
" ``agent_type`` / ``parent_agent_id`` / ``created_at`` / ``active`` / "
"``last_reply`` / ``modified_at``; the registry and lazy-reading rules are the same as REPL ``/agents``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:66 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``POST /agents``：请求体 ``{\"agent_type\"?: str, \"args\"?: dict}`` （空 body "
"合法）→ ``runtime.create_agent()`` （缺省类型 = 项目 默认主 Agent，同 REPL "
"未绑定态隐式创建；池无根记录 → ``400``） → ``201 {\"agent_id\": str}``。创建失败不残留半注册实例。"
msgstr ""
"``POST /agents``: request body ``{\"agent_type\"?: str, \"args\"?: dict}`` (an empty body is legal) → "
"``runtime.create_agent()`` (the default type is the project's default primary Agent, same as the unbound REPL's "
"implicit creation; no root records in the pool → ``400``) → ``201 {\"agent_id\": str}``. A failed creation leaves no half-registered instance behind."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:70 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/messages``：→ ``200``，body 为当前 head "
"上溯链的消息列表（渲染对话用；休眠 id 同样经 ``get_agent`` 恢复）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/messages``: → ``200``, body is the message list of the walk-up chain from the current head "
"(for rendering the conversation; dormant ids are likewise restored via ``get_agent``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:73 of
msgid ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream`` （SSE 长连接）：订阅指定 Agent "
"的钩子并逐事件推送——``on_provider_delta`` 的正文 → ``event: delta`` （流式正文），思考增量 → "
"``event: thinking`` （adapter 真流式时逐段推送）；``after_turn_append`` → ``event: "
"message`` （新消息挂树，工具调用与结果、steer 注入等 对前端可见，data 为消息 JSON）；``after_turn`` → "
"``event: turn_end`` （回合收尾，data 含 ``TurnResult.status``）。 连接断开 / Agent "
"destroy → 订阅清理。一个 POST /message 的等待 期与 SSE 流可以并存。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents/<agent-id>/stream`` (SSE long connection): subscribes to the specified Agent's "
"hooks and pushes event by event — ``on_provider_delta`` body text → ``event: delta`` (streaming body), thinking increments → "
"``event: thinking`` (pushed segment by segment when the adapter is truly streaming); ``after_turn_append`` → ``event: "
"message`` (a new message attached to the tree — tool calls and results, steer injections, etc. become visible to the frontend; data is the message JSON); ``after_turn`` → "
"``event: turn_end`` (turn finished; data contains ``TurnResult.status``). Connection drop / Agent "
"destroy → subscription cleanup. A POST /message waiting period and an SSE stream can coexist."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:82 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/cancel``：→ ``agent.cancel()`` 协作式取消当前回合 → ``200"
" {\"status\": \"cancelled\"}``；无活跃 回合时幂等 ``200 {\"status\": \"idle\"}``。"
msgstr ""
"``POST /agents/<agent-id>/cancel``: → ``agent.cancel()`` cooperatively cancels the current turn → ``200"
" {\"status\": \"cancelled\"}``; when there is no active turn it is idempotent with ``200 {\"status\": \"idle\"}``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:85 of
msgid ""
"``GET /snapshot``：→ ``200``，body 为 ``runtime.snapshot()`` 的 JSON "
"序列化（只读视图）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /snapshot``: → ``200``, body is the JSON serialization of ``runtime.snapshot()`` "
"(a read-only view)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:87 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /healthz``：→ ``200 {\"status\": \"ok\"}``。"
msgstr "``GET /healthz``: → ``200 {\"status\": \"ok\"}``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:89 of
msgid "错误映射与边缘情况："
msgstr "Error mapping and edge cases:"

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:91 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"纯 ghost id（不在活体表也不在池名录）→ ``404``，body ``{\"error\": \"unknown agent\"}`` "
"（对 message / messages / cancel / stream 四个带 id 端点同律；休眠但有记录的 id 不走 "
"``404``—— ``get_agent`` 现场恢复）。活体表中非 Agent 节点（Workflow 等） 按 ghost 同律 "
"``404``。"
msgstr ""
"A pure ghost id (in neither the live table nor the pool registry) → ``404``, body ``{\"error\": \"unknown agent\"}`` "
"(the same rule applies to the four id-carrying endpoints message / messages / cancel / stream; a dormant but recorded id does not get "
"``404`` — ``get_agent`` restores it on the spot). Non-Agent nodes in the live table (Workflow, etc.) are treated like ghosts with the same "
"``404``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:96 of
msgid "请求体缺 ``text`` 字段或 ``text`` 非字符串 → ``400``。"
msgstr "A request body missing the ``text`` field, or ``text`` not being a string → ``400``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:97 of
msgid ""
"``POST /agents`` 的 ``agent_type`` 未注册 → ``400``；setup 抛 异常 → ``500`` "
"（实例不残留，池无半注册）。"
msgstr ""
"An unregistered ``agent_type`` in ``POST /agents`` → ``400``; setup raising an exception → ``500`` "
"(no instance is left behind and the pool has no half-registration)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:99 of
msgid "端点集之外的路径 → ``404``。"
msgstr "Paths outside the endpoint set → ``404``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:100 of
msgid ""
"端口绑定失败 → 打印错误到 stderr，返回 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` （Runtime 已 launch "
"成功的也要先 shutdown 再退出）。"
msgstr ""
"Port binding failure → print the error to stderr and return :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` (even if the Runtime was launched "
"successfully, it is shut down before exiting)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:103 of
msgid "回合进行中服务收到 shutdown：等待中的 POST 连接随 destroy 被 取消，不承诺返回结果。"
msgstr "If the service receives a shutdown mid-turn: pending POST connections are canceled along with the destroy and no result is promised."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:108 flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:39 of
msgid "监听地址，默认 ``127.0.0.1``。"
msgstr "The listen address, default ``127.0.0.1``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:109 flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:40 of
msgid "监听端口，默认 ``8000``。"
msgstr "The listen port, default ``8000``."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:112 flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:43 of
msgid ":data:`EXIT_OK` （正常关闭）或 :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` （``launch`` 失败或端口绑定失败）。"
msgstr ":data:`EXIT_OK` (normal shutdown) or :data:`EXIT_RUNTIME_ERROR` (``launch`` failed or port binding failed)."

#: flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve:117 of
msgid ""
":data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS`、:func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web` "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query` "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`"
msgstr ""
":data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS`, :func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web` "
":meth:`flowing.agent.Agent.query` "
":meth:`flowing.runtime.Runtime.snapshot`"

#: ../../api/flowing.interfaces.rst:61
msgid "flowing.interfaces.web module"
msgstr "flowing.interfaces.web module"

#: flowing.interfaces.web:5 of
msgid ""
"本模块定义 ``web`` 子命令与 Web 暴露层的唯一交接点： :func:`get_frontend_assets`。在 flowing "
"的架构里，UI 是几个“下游 应用”的例子——``flowing.interfaces.web`` 承载的只是 ``web`` 子命令 "
"所需的（内置默认）前端资产：一个用公开 API 拼出的可对话页面（发消息、 流式显示、查快照、选择 / 切换 / 新建 Agent）。"
msgstr ""
"This module defines the sole handoff point between the ``web`` subcommand and the Web interface layer: :func:`get_frontend_assets`. In flowing's "
"architecture, the UI is an example of one of the \"downstream applications\" — ``flowing.interfaces.web`` carries only the (builtin default) frontend assets needed by the ``web`` "
"subcommand: a conversational page assembled from the public API (sending messages, streaming display, viewing snapshots, selecting / switching / creating Agents)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:11 of
msgid ""
"框架核心只提供“HTTP API”这个机制（``flowing serve`` 已完整）； "
"“给不给前端、前端长什么样”是暴露层的策略，由本模块承载。替换或 移除前端不影响 "
":data:`flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS` 中的 任何一条。``web`` "
"命令只是“serve + 加载本模块前端资产”的便捷组合。"
msgstr ""
"The framework core only provides the \"HTTP API\" mechanism (already complete in ``flowing serve\"); "
"\"whether to ship a frontend and what it looks like\" is an interface-layer policy carried by this module. Replacing or removing the frontend does not affect "
"any entry in :data:`flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS`. The ``web`` "
"command is just a convenient combination of \"serve + loading this module's frontend assets\"."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:17 of
msgid "内置前端范围"
msgstr "Builtin Frontend Scope"

#: flowing.interfaces.web:18 of
msgid ""
"内置默认前端是持续对话页面：经 ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message`` 发消息，经 ``GET /agents"
"/<agent-id>/stream`` （SSE）流式显示生成过程 （正在生成 → 流式 delta → 完整生成两段式；工具调用与 steer"
" 注入经 ``message`` 事件可见），可查看快照，可选择 / 切换 Agent（``GET /agents`` 下拉），可新建 "
"Agent。"
msgstr ""
"The builtin default frontend is a persistent conversation page: messages are sent via ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``, and the generation process is displayed streaming via ``GET /agents"
"/<agent-id>/stream`` (SSE) (generating → streaming delta → completed, in two phases; tool calls and steer"
" injections are visible via ``message`` events); it can view snapshots, select / switch Agents (a ``GET /agents`` dropdown), and create new "
"Agents."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:24 of
msgid ""
"根选取行为（serve 端点对根选取无状态，选取全在客户端）：页面加载时 ``GET /agents`` 列出根 Agent（id + "
"最后回复前缀 + 最后修改时间，口径 同 REPL ``/agents``）；多根默认选中最后修改时间最新的根，页面常显 当前目标 "
"id，下拉可切换；零根显示空态页并提供“新建 Agent”入口 （经 ``POST /agents``）。"
msgstr ""
"Root selection behavior (serve's endpoints are stateless about root selection — selection is entirely client-side): on page load, ``GET /agents`` lists the root Agents (id + "
"last-reply prefix + last-modified time, same criteria as REPL ``/agents``); with multiple roots the one with the newest last-modified time is selected by default, the page always shows the current target "
"id, and the dropdown can switch; with zero roots an empty-state page is shown with a \"create Agent\" entry (via ``POST /agents``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:30 of
msgid "边界："
msgstr "Boundaries:"

#: flowing.interfaces.web:32 of
msgid ""
"前端页面与 Runtime 的交互只有 serve 的封闭 HTTP 端点一条通道 （消息投递 / 观察流 / 控制与读取端点）；前端不绕过 "
"serve API 另开 消息通道（例如直连 Agent 的内部方法）。这保证“HTTP 请求与 CLI 输入等价”的不变量在 web "
"形态下同样成立。"
msgstr ""
"The frontend page interacts with the Runtime through exactly one channel: serve's closed HTTP endpoints (message delivery / observation streams / control and read endpoints); the frontend never bypasses the "
"serve API to open another message channel (for example, calling an Agent's internal methods directly). This guarantees that the \"HTTP requests are equivalent to CLI input\" invariant also holds in the web "
"form."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:36 of
msgid ""
"本模块不做任何构建 / 打包：资产在 import 本模块时即已就绪， ``GET /`` 与 ``GET /assets/*`` 只是读取 "
":class:`FrontendAssets` 的字段。WebSocket 不引入——流式推送由 serve 的 SSE 端点承载。"
msgstr ""
"This module does no building / bundling: the assets are ready the moment this module is imported, and ``GET /`` and ``GET /assets/*`` merely read the fields of "
":class:`FrontendAssets`. WebSocket is not introduced — streaming push is carried by serve's SSE endpoint."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:49 flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:37 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web:50 of
msgid "本模块资产的唯一消费者（web 增量端点 ``GET /`` 与 ``GET /assets/*``）。"
msgstr "The sole consumer of this module's assets (the web incremental endpoints ``GET /`` and ``GET /assets/*``)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web:52 of
msgid ":data:`flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS`"
msgstr ":data:`flowing.interfaces.serve.SERVE_ENDPOINTS`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web:53 of
msgid "前端赖以交互的 HTTP API 封闭集。"
msgstr "The closed set of HTTP APIs the frontend relies on for interaction."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:1 of
msgid "前端资产包：入口页 HTML + 静态资源表。"
msgstr "Frontend asset bundle: entry-page HTML + a static-asset table."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:3 of
msgid ""
"``web`` 子命令挂载前端所需的全部内容的自包含结构体，实例为只读 值对象（字段构造后不被修改）。``GET /`` 返回 "
":attr:`index_html`， ``GET /assets/<name>`` 在 :attr:`assets` 中按键查找。"
msgstr ""
"A self-contained struct holding everything the ``web`` subcommand needs to mount the frontend; instances are read-only value objects (fields are not modified after construction). ``GET /`` returns "
":attr:`index_html`, and ``GET /assets/<name>`` looks up :attr:`assets` by key."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:19 of
msgid ":attr:`index_html` 非空且是完整 HTML 文档。"
msgstr ":attr:`index_html` is non-empty and is a complete HTML document."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:20 of
msgid ":attr:`assets` 的键为 ``/assets/`` 下的相对路径（不含前导斜杠、 不含 ``..`` 段），值为资源字节流。"
msgstr "The keys of :attr:`assets` are relative paths under ``/assets/`` (no leading slash, no ``..`` segments); the values are asset byte streams."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:22 of
msgid "未命中的键由 web 层映射为 ``404``，本类不负责错误响应。"
msgstr "Missed keys are mapped to ``404`` by the web layer; this class is not responsible for error responses."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets:24 of
msgid ":func:`get_frontend_assets`、:func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`"
msgstr ":func:`get_frontend_assets`, :func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.index_html:1 of
msgid "前端入口页 HTML 文档：``GET /`` 的唯一响应内容；自包含完整 文档，浏览器打开即可加载 :attr:`assets` 中的静态资源。"
msgstr "The frontend entry-page HTML document: the sole response content of ``GET /``; a self-contained complete document that loads the static assets in :attr:`assets` as soon as the browser opens it."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.index_html:4 of
msgid ""
"行为边界：非空 ``str``；引用的静态资源路径必须以 ``/assets/`` 为前缀，且每个被引用的路径（去掉 ``/assets/`` "
"前缀后）必须能在 :attr:`assets` 中命中——不满足即视为资产包损坏。"
msgstr ""
"Behavioral boundary: a non-empty ``str``; every referenced static-asset path must be prefixed with ``/assets/``, and every referenced path (with the ``/assets/`` "
"prefix removed) must hit in :attr:`assets` — otherwise the asset bundle is considered corrupted."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.index_html:8 of
msgid ":attr:`assets`"
msgstr ":attr:`assets`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.assets:1 of
msgid "静态资源表：``GET /assets/*`` 的查找来源；以内存表形式承载， web 层无需访问文件系统。"
msgstr "The static-asset table: the lookup source for ``GET /assets/*``; carried as an in-memory table so the web layer never touches the filesystem."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.assets:4 of
msgid ""
"行为边界：键为 ``/assets/`` 下的相对路径（不含前导斜杠、不含 ``..`` 段）；值为资源字节流；表在构造后不可变。键的查找是精确 "
"匹配，不做目录列举。"
msgstr ""
"Behavioral boundary: keys are relative paths under ``/assets/`` (no leading slash, no ``..`` segments); values are asset byte streams; the table is immutable after construction. Key lookup is exact "
"matching — no directory listing."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.FrontendAssets.assets:8 of
msgid ":attr:`index_html`"
msgstr ":attr:`index_html`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:1 of
msgid "返回前端资产包。"
msgstr "Returns the frontend asset bundle."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:3 of
msgid ""
"``web`` 子命令获取前端资产的唯一入口。资产本体是 仓库根 ``webui/`` 的构建产物（单文件 ``webui-"
"dist/index.html``，全部 JS/CSS 内联）：亮色聊天界面（样式变量 借用 kimi-code web "
"界面亮色主题）：agent 侧栏（含最近回复预览）+ “记录 / 树”双子页（记录视图渲染消息树——仅分叉处缩进、分叉首条 "
"消息可开合、每条消息带预览，树子页可点节点切换分支），消息正文 Markdown 渲染（react-markdown + "
"GFM）、思考折叠、工具调用/返回折叠卡 （展开为 JSON 高亮）、输入框上方上下文占用进度条、头部模型选择； 输入框支持消息与 repl "
"指令（经 serve 的观察 / 控制端点）。"
msgstr ""
"The sole entry point for the ``web`` subcommand to obtain frontend assets. The asset body is the build artifact of the repository-root ``webui/`` (a single file ``webui-"
"dist/index.html`` with all JS/CSS inlined): a light-themed chat interface (style variables borrowed from the kimi-code web "
"UI's light theme): an agent sidebar (with recent reply previews) + dual sub-pages \"messages / tree\" (the messages view renders the message tree — indenting only at forks, the first message of a fork "
"is collapsible, and every message carries a preview; the tree sub-page can click nodes to switch branches), Markdown rendering of message bodies (react-markdown + "
"GFM), collapsible thinking, collapsible cards for tool calls / results (expanding to highlighted JSON), a context-usage progress bar above the input box, and model selection in the header; the input box supports both messages and repl "
"commands (via serve's observation / control endpoints)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:13 of
msgid ""
"本内置资产即 ``web`` 的默认前端来源（``GET /`` 与 ``GET /assets/*`` 的返回即此资产包；单文件形态下 "
"``assets`` 表为空，``/assets/*`` 一律 404）。"
msgstr ""
"This builtin asset bundle is the default frontend source of ``web`` (the responses of ``GET /`` and ``GET /assets/*`` are exactly this bundle; in the single-file form the "
"``assets`` table is empty and ``/assets/*`` always returns 404)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:27 of
msgid "同步调用、只读发布目录文件、无网络活动。"
msgstr "Synchronous call, read-only access to the published directory files, no network activity."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:28 of
msgid "可重复调用，每次返回内容等价的资产包（允许返回同一缓存实例）。"
msgstr "Repeatable; each call returns a content-equivalent asset bundle (returning the same cached instance is allowed)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:29 of
msgid "不接受任何参数；不读取子项目配置。"
msgstr "Accepts no arguments; does not read subproject configuration."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:30 of
msgid ""
"``webui-dist/index.html`` 缺失（仓库未构建即打包）→ "
":class:`FileNotFoundError`（发布缺陷，fail fast 不静默降级）。"
msgstr ""
"Missing ``webui-dist/index.html`` (the repository was packaged without building) → "
":class:`FileNotFoundError` (a release defect; fail fast, no silent degradation)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:35 of
msgid ":class:`FrontendAssets`"
msgstr ":class:`FrontendAssets`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:36 of
msgid "返回结构的字段契约。"
msgstr "The field contract of the returned structure."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:38 of
msgid "唯一消费者；``GET /`` 与 ``GET /assets/*`` 的映射规则。"
msgstr "The sole consumer; the mapping rules of ``GET /`` and ``GET /assets/*``."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:39 of
msgid ":data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS`"
msgstr ":data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets:40 of
msgid "web 相对 serve 的增量端点封闭集。"
msgstr "The closed set of incremental endpoints web adds relative to serve."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS:1 of
msgid ""
"``web`` 相对 ``serve`` 的增量端点封闭集：``web`` 就是“serve + 一个 "
"策略性前端”，前端不进入框架核心——替换或移除前端不影响 :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` 中的任何 HTTP API。"
msgstr ""
"The closed set of incremental endpoints ``web`` adds relative to ``serve``: ``web`` is simply \"serve + one policy "
"frontend\", and the frontend never enters the framework core — replacing or removing the frontend does not affect any HTTP API in :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS`."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS:5 of
msgid "``GET /``：返回 ``get_frontend_assets().index_html`` （前端入口页）。"
msgstr "``GET /``: returns ``get_frontend_assets().index_html`` (the frontend entry page)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS:6 of
msgid ""
"``GET /assets/*``：返回 ``get_frontend_assets().assets`` 中对应 键的静态资源（js / css"
" 等）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /assets/*``: returns the static asset (js / css, etc.) of the corresponding key in "
"``get_frontend_assets().assets``."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS:9 of
msgid ""
"``web`` 只有封闭端点集一条消息入口——前端页面同样经 ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message`` 与 "
"Runtime 交互，不允许绕过 serve 的 HTTP API 另开消息通道。"
msgstr ""
"``web`` has exactly one message entrance — the closed endpoint set: the frontend page likewise interacts with the Runtime via ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``, and bypassing serve's "
"HTTP API to open another message channel is not allowed."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS:13 of
msgid ":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`、:func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets`"
msgstr ":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web`, :func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets`"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:1 of
msgid "``flowing web <path>``：serve 骨架 + serve 前端页面。"
msgstr "``flowing web <path>``: the serve skeleton plus the serve frontend pages."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:5 of
msgid ""
"与 :func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve` 共享同一个 HTTP 骨架与全部 "
":data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS`，额外挂载 :data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS` （``GET /`` "
"返回前端入口页、 ``GET /assets/*`` 返回静态资源），供浏览器直接打开交互。前端 资产来自 "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets`。"
msgstr ""
"Shares the same HTTP skeleton and all of :data:`SERVE_ENDPOINTS` with :func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve`, "
"additionally mounting :data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS` (``GET /`` returns the frontend entry page, "
"``GET /assets/*`` returns static assets) for browsers to open and interact with directly. The frontend assets come from "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets`."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:11 of
msgid ""
"``web`` 只是“serve + 加载前端资产”的便捷组合——替换或移除 前端不影响任何 HTTP API，前端也只有 ``POST "
"/agents/<agent-id>/message`` 一条消息入口。"
msgstr ""
"``web`` is just a convenient combination of \"serve + loading frontend assets\" — replacing or removing the frontend affects no HTTP API, and the frontend also has only ``POST "
"/agents/<agent-id>/message`` as its single message entrance."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:24 of
msgid "时序与端点契约完全继承 :func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve` （同一 HTTP 骨架），增量为："
msgstr "The sequence and endpoint contract are fully inherited from :func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve` (the same HTTP skeleton); the increments are:"

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:27 of
msgid ""
"``GET /`` → ``200``，body 为 ``get_frontend_assets().index_html``， "
"``Content-Type: text/html``。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /`` → ``200``, body is ``get_frontend_assets().index_html``, "
"``Content-Type: text/html``."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:29 of
msgid ""
"``GET /assets/<name>`` → 在 ``get_frontend_assets().assets`` 中按键精确查找，命中返回 "
"``200`` 与对应字节流；未命中 ``404`` （含资产缺键：按未命中处理，不报错退出）。"
msgstr ""
"``GET /assets/<name>`` → exact key lookup in ``get_frontend_assets().assets``; a hit returns "
"``200`` with the corresponding byte stream, a miss returns ``404`` (including missing asset keys: handled as a miss, without erroring out)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:33 of
msgid ""
"边界：不为前端另开消息通道（前端经 ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message`` 与 Runtime 交互）；不在 "
"CLI 层做任何前端构建 / 打包（资产在 ``flowing.interfaces.web`` 层就绪）。"
msgstr ""
"Boundaries: no separate message channel is opened for the frontend (the frontend interacts with the Runtime via ``POST /agents/<agent-id>/message``); no frontend building / "
"bundling happens at the CLI layer (assets are ready at the ``flowing.interfaces.web`` layer)."

#: flowing.interfaces.web.cmd_web:48 of
msgid ""
":func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve`、:data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS` "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets` —— 前端资产的唯一来源。"
msgstr ""
":func:`flowing.interfaces.serve.cmd_serve`, :data:`WEB_EXTRA_ENDPOINTS` "
":func:`flowing.interfaces.web.get_frontend_assets` —— the sole source of the frontend assets."
